  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli nigo banga buna omosabibu okororekana ore omuya mono okwama amasabibu. Buna koreng’ana okwama kwabo kwamentekanete, naboigo bagendererete koagacha ebisasimero ebinge; na buna bagendererete gotenenka, naboigo bagendererete gotenenia chisiiro bagosasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo bare abang’ainereria ase chinkoro chiabo; ase ayio goika baegwe egesusuro gi’okomocha kwabo. Omonene natagore ebisasimero biabo, atagore ne chisiiro chiabo bagosasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto abwo mbateebe, “Titobwati omorwoti, ekiagera titomoirogeti Omonene. Inee! Toraba nomorwoti, ngento ki aratokorere?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo bagokwana amang’ana atari nengencho, naende betiania ase oborimo ekero bagokora okobwatana kw’ogotianania; ase igo ekiina nigo gekobacheera buna ekemeri kere nobosongo ase emetaro ya mogondo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bamenyete Samaria mbatengechigwe ase engencho y’omogwekano bw’emori bagosasiima agwo Beti‐Aveni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo bakoyosasiima mbarere, na abakuani baye mbeng’ererie, ekiagera obonene bwaye bwasirigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omogwekano oyio noirwe Asuri, oegwe omorwoti Yarebu buna ekeegwa. Abaefraimu mbabe nobosooku, na Abaisraeli mbasookigwe boigo ase engencho y’emeroberio yabo abanyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti o Samaria nasirigwe arueo buna riuro rigosira korwa ase amaache igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aase aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa agwo Aveni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ase Abaisraeli bakoreire ebibe, nasirigwe. Amagwa na amageri mbimere ase ebisasimero biabo; erio abanto abwo bateebie ebitunwa: “Totube”, na ebigoro: “Togwere”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonene okonachera Abaisraeli ekiina.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe Abaisraeli, nigo mwagendererete gokora ebibe korwa ase amatuko aria mwarenge Gibea, na goika bono nigo mogendererete gokora bo. Inee! Esegi y’okorusia egesiomba igoro y’abakori amabe tiyababuete agwo Gibea?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ndaganie, nimbae egesusuro gi’okobarongeyia, erio abanto b’ebisaku ebiaao mbasangererekane amo, baabachere amo baabae egesusuro ase engencho y’ebibe biabo bibere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaefraimu nigo baarenge buna ritororo riorokereretigwe buya, rianchete koora, inche nigo nabegete rikorogoto ase ebigoti biabo ebiya. Bono nimbeekere Abaefraimu rikorogoto, nonya n’Abayuda goika babe bakorema, na Abayakobo goika babe bakobosa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebusurere oboronge, mogese ayare ay’obwanchani, eremere chimbuna chiaino, ekiagera eye nero engaki y’okomorigia Omonene, erinde ache abatwerie oboronge buna embura egotwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwasimekire ayare amabe, mwagesire aya atari ay’oboronge, mwarire ayare okwama kw’oborimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nigo mwasemeretie ogokora kwaino, na obonge bw’abasikari baino chituoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio eriomana rie chiseegi ndibe ase egati y’abanto baino, ne chiburi chiaino chisarigwe, buna omorwoti Salimani asaretie Beti‐Aribeli ase rituko riria ri’esegi, abang’ina amo nabana babo banachanetwe bakaba ebing’ese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo na abanto ba Beteli barabakore ase engencho y’obobe bwaino obonene. Kobogokiamoka omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli naitwe akwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
